# Trivy suppressions (pull request gate 4, vulnerabilities).
#
# One advisory ID per line (e.g. CVE-2026-12345 or GHSA-xxxx-xxxx-xxxx), each
# preceded by a "#" comment stating the justification: why the vulnerable code
# path is unreachable or what mitigates it, and when the entry will be
# reviewed. Keep entries as narrow as possible and remove them as soon as a
# fixed version is available.
